# ssh-targets.conf.example
# Copy this file to ssh-targets.conf and edit the lines.
#
# Format (required):
#   Display name|user@host
#
# Rules:
#   - One target per line
#   - Separate the label and the SSH destination with a single pipe |
#   - Lines starting with # are comments
#   - Blank lines are ignored
#   - Do not wrap values in quotes

# Examples
Office Linux|alice@192.168.1.10
Jump host|bob@bastion.example.com